rightdunitƒerightdunitƒdleftdstardunit‚dmarkxáRewrite the summary field as a standalone three-sentence synopsis (the event, the key numbers, the analytical frame) distinct from the lede; the current summary is a near-verbatim repetition of the lede's first two sentences.ƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;bn2Kb_-Cy1ky-rPP05eDkpr8wOXNUkX1Y4lQtjsPU6sƒdpairƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒdleftdstardunit‚dmarkyThe sources and assignment are sound, and the deterministic gate cleared with warnings only. However, the writer model produced a draft with eight bounded, repairable defects: prohibited "will" in the lede; an attribution-formula construction used approximately ten times against a hard limit of two; only two body sections against the required three to five; five near-duplicate proximity pairs identified by the gate; a headline that elevates "Messi's Magic" to coequal status with geometry contrary to the primary source's organizing frame; a misattributed "speed of reconfiguration/recognition" phrase credited to the supporting context article rather than the geometry source that coined it; a direct citation to a Reuters URL not in the admitted sources; and a summary field that copies the lede rather than forming a distinct synopsis. All defects are bounded prose repairs; no new reporting is required.ƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;UYs8-wGEeHT8Llq6NqRjk89c-Uyq69ixiNW3Ehiamnoƒdpairƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒdleftdstardunit‚dmarkwsubmit_revision_requestƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;I5u_Rk9Wt5KpgCdK4OZTfuisK9y79hYR1ezK0XkzOZkƒdpairƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒdleftdstardunit‚dmarkgsuccessƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;D9A5EIqpv7z7FK4R9tA_9DdhkbaOWUEHyI7bhhOyRysƒdpairƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒdleftdstardunit‚